    "en": {
      "trackName": "Robo Logic: Code Puzzles",
      "description": "Think like a programmer. Solve like a robot.\nRobo Logic is a minimalist puzzle game that challenges you to guide a robot to its target on a 5x5 cyber grid -- using only directional commands. No direct control. No shortcuts. Just pure logic.\nHOW TO PLAY\nQueue up movement commands: Up, Down, Left, Right\nHit RUN and watch your robot execute the sequence\nReach the goal to advance. Go off-grid and you crash.\nSimple to learn. Deceptively tricky to master.\nFEATURES\nEndless procedurally generated levels\nRetro-futuristic neon aesthetic with CRT scanline effects\nHaptic feedback on every step, crash, and victory\nScore system that rewards efficiency -- fewer moves, more points\nDesigned exclusively for Apple Watch\nWhether you're waiting in line, riding the train, or just have 30 seconds to kill -- Robo Logic turns idle moments into brain training.\nNo ads. No internet required. Just you, a grid, and a robot.",
